(Stage 1e2 - iterate a map's keys in insertion order. map's keys yields a
 fresh list of key texts, and a for-each over it types the loop variable
 as text so each key prints as a string. Acceptance: a, b, c in order.)

a map called "m" is {"a": 1, "b": 2, "c": 3}.
for each key in m's keys
  print key.